# 58. HERO CANNOT BE DUPLICATED

The same Hero ID cannot occupy two Party slots simultaneously unless the game explicitly creates a special clone/summon mechanic.

Example:

```text
HERO-000021

PARTY 1 → YES

PARTY 2 → NO
```

This follows the unique Hero identity rules of the Character System.

