# 75. PARTY SYSTEM RULES

### Rule 1

> **Maximum 5 Heroes per Party.**

### Rule 2

> **Party 1 and Party 2 have a Leader appointed by the Master.**

### Rule 3

> **The Leader of Party 1 and Party 2 may create their own Party composition.**

### Rule 4

> **The Master always retains final authority.**

### Rule 5

> **Party 3 and above are directly composed by the Master.**

### Rule 6

> **A Hero cannot normally occupy multiple Party slots simultaneously.**

### Rule 7

> **Party composition does not duplicate Hero data. It references Hero IDs.**

### Rule 8

> **Party state is synchronized through the Game State System.**

### Rule 9

> **Persistent Party data is stored in the Database System.**

### Rule 10

> **Combat behavior is handled by the Combat and AI systems.**

### Rule 11

> **The AI Fairy observes Party conditions and reports important information to the Master.**

### Rule 12

> **Party difficulty is influenced by the Floor and Destruction Level.**

