# 🌑 FINAL DESIGN PRINCIPLE

The Party System is designed so that the Master does not have to manually micromanage every Hero.

For **Party 1 and Party 2**:

```text
MASTER
   ↓
Choose Leader
   ↓
Leader understands available Heroes
   ↓
Leader creates composition
   ↓
AI evaluates synergy
   ↓
Party enters mission
```

For **Party 3 and above**:

```text
MASTER
   ↓
Choose Heroes
   ↓
Create composition
   ↓
Set formation
   ↓
Deploy
```

The result is a Party System where different Parties can develop their own identities.

```text
PARTY 1
→ Leader-driven

PARTY 2
→ Leader-driven

PARTY 3+
→ Master-driven
```

The Party therefore becomes more than a collection of five Heroes.

It becomes:

> **A living team whose composition, leadership, relationships, emotions, AI behavior, and combat history can evolve together as the Master climbs the Tower of Rebirth.**
